1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,071
You've been carving pumpkins wrong your whole life.

2
00:00:03,071 --> 00:00:04,712
Stop cutting the top off.

3
00:00:04,712 --> 00:00:11,319
When you cut a lid around the stem, the pumpkin starts drying out, the lid shrinks, and it falls right inside.

4
00:00:11,319 --> 00:00:14,691
Plus you're reaching through a tiny hole, scraping blindly.

5
00:00:14,691 --> 00:00:18,106
Instead, flip it over and cut a circle out of the bottom.

6
00:00:18,106 --> 00:00:22,269
Most of the seeds and guts come out attached to that piece in one pull.

7
00:00:22,269 --> 00:00:25,379
But here's the trick that makes it the easiest carve ever...

8
00:00:25,379 --> 00:00:27,549
No more lighting a candle inside.

9
00:00:27,549 --> 00:00:32,725
Just put your candle or LED light on the table and lower the whole pumpkin over it.

10
00:00:32,725 --> 00:00:35,610
Flat base, no wobble, stem stays perfect.

11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:39,360
Subscribe, before your pumpkin's lid caves in again.
